@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

title MED-06 - COMPONENT DIAGRAM

actor Guest
actor Attendee
actor Organizer
actor "Check-in Staff" as Staff
actor Administrator as Admin

component "Next.js Web App" as FE {
  [Public Event UI]
  [Attendee UI]
  [Organizer UI]
  [Check-in UI]
  [Admin UI]
}

component "NestJS Modular Monolith" as BE {
  [Auth Module]
  [Users Module]
  [Events Module]
  [Sessions Module]
  [Registrations Module]
  [Allocation Module]
  [Waitlist Module]
  [Tickets Module]
  [CheckIn Module]
  [Accessibility Module]
  [Search Module]
  [AntiBot / RateLimit]
}

database "PostgreSQL" as DB
cloud "Object Storage\n(S3/MinIO compatible)" as OS

Guest --> [Public Event UI]
Attendee --> [Attendee UI]
Organizer --> [Organizer UI]
Staff --> [Check-in UI]
Admin --> [Admin UI]

FE --> BE : REST/JSON over HTTPS

[Auth Module] --> DB
[Users Module] --> DB
[Events Module] --> DB
[Sessions Module] --> DB
[Registrations Module] --> DB
[Allocation Module] --> DB
[Waitlist Module] --> DB
[Tickets Module] --> DB
[CheckIn Module] --> DB
[Accessibility Module] --> DB
[Search Module] --> DB : PostgreSQL FTS/ILIKE

[Events Module] --> OS : event images
[Registrations Module] --> [AntiBot / RateLimit]
[Registrations Module] --> [Allocation Module]
[Allocation Module] --> [Waitlist Module]
[Allocation Module] --> [Tickets Module]
[CheckIn Module] --> [Tickets Module]
[Events Module] --> [Accessibility Module]

note right of BE
Một deployable backend duy nhất.
Module tách trách nhiệm theo domain,
không dùng microservices trong MVP.
end note

note bottom of [Allocation Module]
Chứa TicketAllocationStrategy,
FcfsAllocationStrategy và
LotteryAllocationStrategy.
end note

@enduml
